<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Financial Aid Checklist</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 10px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">Wabash College</h1>
  <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 0;">Merit Scholarships and Awards</h2>
  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0;">DOMESTIC STUDENTS ENTERING WABASH 2022-2023</h3>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">SCHOLARSHIP CRITERIA*</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Scholarship amounts are renewable annually for four years. Grades and test scores will be reviewed through <span data-field="review_date">{{ review_date }}</span>.</p>
  </div>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 20px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 20%;">UNWEIGHTED HIGH SCHOOL GPA</th>
        <th style="width: 40%;">AWARD LEVEL</th>
        <th style="width: 40%;">AWARD AMOUNT</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>3.80+</td>
        <td></td>
        <td>up to <span data-field="scholarship_amount_1">{{ scholarship_amount_1 }}</span> PRESIDENT'S SCHOLARSHIP</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>3.6–3.79</td>
        <td></td>
        <td>up to <span data-field="scholarship_amount_2">{{ scholarship_amount_2 }}</span> PRESIDENT'S SCHOLARSHIP</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>3.40–3.59</td>
        <td></td>
        <td>up to <span data-field="scholarship_amount_3">{{ scholarship_amount_3 }}</span> DEAN'S SCHOLARSHIP</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>3.20–3.39</td>
        <td></td>
        <td>up to <span data-field="scholarship_amount_4">{{ scholarship_amount_4 }}</span> DEAN'S SCHOLARSHIP</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>3.00–3.19</td>
        <td></td>
        <td>up to <span data-field="scholarship_amount_5">{{ scholarship_amount_5 }}</span> ALUMNI AWARD</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 10pt;">
    <p>Scholarship amounts within the ranges are determined by a holistic review of your academic achievements, including grade trend, strength of curriculum, test scores (if submitted), and class rank (if available).</p>
    <p>If your GPA is not on this list, contact us at <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span> or call 800-<span data-field="contact_phone_suffix">{{ contact_phone_suffix }}</span>.</p>
    <p>*Wabash College practices test-optional admissions. Applicants are not required to submit standardized test scores as part of their application for admission.</p>
    <p>All standardized test score submissions will be super scored.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">WABASH COLLEGE FINANCIAL AID PROCESS CHECKLIST</h1>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">STEP 1</h3>
      <table style="width: 100%;">
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 10%;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">WHAT:</span></td>
          <td style="width: 90%;"><span data-field="step1_what">{{ step1_what }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 10%;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">WHY:</span></td>
          <td style="width: 90%;"><span data-field="step1_why">{{ step1_why }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 10%;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">WHERE:</span></td>
          <td style="width: 90%;"><span data-field="step1_where">{{ step1_where }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 10%;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">WHEN:</span></td>
          <td style="width: 90%;"><span data-field="step1_when">{{ step1_when }}</span></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div style="width: 48%;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">STEP 2</h3>
      <table style="width: 100%;">
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 10%;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">WHAT:</span></td>
          <td style="width: 90%;"><span data-field="step2_what">{{ step2_what }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 10%;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">WHY:</span></td>
          <td style="width: 90%;"><span data-field="step2_why">{{ step2_why }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 10%;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">WHERE:</span></td>
          <td style="width: 90%;"><span data-field="step2_where">{{ step2_where }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="width: 10%;"><span style="font-weight: bold;">WHEN:</span></td>
          <td style="width: 90%;"><span data-field="step2_when">{{ step2_when }}</span></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; font-size: 10pt;">
    <p>Free Application for Federal Student Aid (FAFSA) Wabash College federal code -- <span data-field="fafsa_code">{{ fafsa_code }}</span></p>
    <p>If you have any questions or need assistance with this process, please contact the Wabash Financial Aid Office at 800-<span data-field="aid_phone_suffix">{{ aid_phone_suffix }}</span> or email at <span data-field="aid_email">{{ aid_email }}</span>.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 32%;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">ADDITIONAL SCHOLARSHIPS</h3>
      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <p><strong>Early Decision Scholarship</strong></p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Scholarship in addition to merit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <p><strong>Honors Scholarship</strong></p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Guaranteed <span data-field="honors_scholarship_amount">{{ honors_scholarship_amount }}</span> scholarship per year for four years to earn up to a full-tuition scholarship.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <p><strong>Wabash College Lilly Awards</strong></p>
        <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Tuition, fees, on-campus room and board each year. More than <span data-field="lilly_award_threshold">{{ lilly_award_threshold }}</span> over four years.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="width: 32%;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">HOW TO APPLY</h3>
      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <p>Apply Early Decision to the College by <span data-field="early_decision_deadline">{{ early_decision_deadline }}</span>.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <p>Apply for Admission and register for event by <span data-field="honors_application_deadline">{{ honors_application_deadline }}</span>.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <p>Complete application for admission and submit the Lilly Award application by <span data-field="lilly_application_deadline">{{ lilly_application_deadline }}</span>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="width: 32%;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">SELECTION CRITERIA</h3>
      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <p>A holistic review of your academic achievements, including grade trend, strength of curriculum, test scores (if submitted), and class rank (if available).</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <p>Attend Scarlet Honors Weekend, December 10, 2021.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
        <p>Based on character, creativity, and academic accomplishment. Finalists interviewed February 20–21, 2022.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px; font-size: 10pt;">
    <ul>
      <li>Students selected as Lilly Award recipients are not eligible for additional Wabash Merit-Based Scholarships/Awards.</li>
      <li>Wabash College is a Division III member of the NCAA. Consequently, we cannot consider a candidate's participation, ability, or leadership roles in athletics when awarding Wabash scholarships.</li>
      <li>For full consideration for merit scholarship and awards and need-based financial aid, complete application for admission by <span data-field="full_consideration_deadline">{{ full_consideration_deadline }}</span>.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 80px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 36pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Wabash.</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Visit <span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span> to learn more</p>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 50px; font-size: 10pt;">
    OS2022
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>